### Backend checks without the UI ("the frontend can be bypassed, the backend still says no")
### Use with the VS Code extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client): click "Send Request" above each block.
### All requests go through the approuter (:5000), exactly like the browser.

@base = http://localhost:5000/odata/v4/supplier
@email = demo{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}@test.com

### 1) Register (copy "token" from the response into @token below)
# @name register
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: tr

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "Str0ng!Pass" }

###
@token = {{register.response.body.token}}

### 2) Weak password -> 400 PASSWORD_WEAK
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: tr

{ "email": "weak@test.com", "password": "abc" }

### 3) Empty required fields -> 400 (backend check, no UI involved)
POST {{base}}/saveApplication
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: tr
X-Supplier-Token: {{token}}

{ "companyName": "", "contactPerson": "" }

### 4) Valid draft (copy the ID)
# @name draft
POST {{base}}/saveApplication
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: tr
X-Supplier-Token: {{token}}

{ "companyName": "Demo A.S.", "contactPerson": "Ayse Yilmaz", "category": "HARDWARE" }

###
@id = {{draft.response.body.ID}}

### 5) Submit without certificate -> 400 CERTIFICATE_REQUIRED
POST {{base}}/submitApplication
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: tr
X-Supplier-Token: {{token}}

{}

### 6) Upload a text file -> 415 CERTIFICATE_NOT_PDF
PUT {{base}}/CertificateUploads({{id}})/certificate
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept-Language: tr
X-Supplier-Token: {{token}}

< ./files/not-a-pdf.txt

### 7) Upload a PNG renamed to .pdf, sent as application/pdf -> 415 (content is checked: "%PDF-")
PUT {{base}}/CertificateUploads({{id}})/certificate
Content-Type: application/pdf
Accept-Language: tr
X-Supplier-Token: {{token}}

< ./files/renamed-image.pdf

### 8) Upload > 10 MB -> 413 CERTIFICATE_TOO_LARGE
PUT {{base}}/CertificateUploads({{id}})/certificate
Content-Type: application/pdf
Accept-Language: tr
X-Supplier-Token: {{token}}

< ./files/too-large-11mb.pdf

### 9) Approver endpoint without login -> approuter does not let it through (401 / login redirect)
GET {{base}}/Suppliers
